# What never belongs in a build context.
#
# The images copy the repository rather than an enumerated list of paths.
# Three times the list was wrong - make, VERSION and packaging/ each missing
# in turn - because it restates the tree and drifts from it. A list of things
# to exclude is stable: caches and build output, which change rarely and are
# obvious when they change.

.git
.gitignore

# Dependency caches, all rebuildable and some large.
local
.cpanm
.perldeps
.easyrsa
.webmin

# Build output. The container builds its own.
build

# The vendored third-party module, kept for reference and used by nothing the
# containers run.
openvpn
openvpn.wbm.gz
